arp     | B3- F#4- B4- D5- C#5- F#4- | F#4- C#5- F#5- A5- G#5- C#5- | G3- D4- G4- B4- A4- D4- | C#4- G#4- C#5- E#5- D#5- G#4- |
vibes   | .--- D6------- | .--- C#6------- | .--- F#5------- | .--- B5------- |
vibes   | .--- D6------- | .--- A5------- | .--- B5------- | .--- G#5------- |
pad     | [Bm]?----------- | [F#m]?----------- | [D]?----------- | [E]?----------- |
pad     | [Bm]?----------- | [F#m]?----------- | [G]?----------- | [C#]?----------- |
bass    | B1----------- | F#1----------- | D2----------- | E2----------- |
bass    | B1----------- | F#1----------- | G1----------- | C#2----------- |
wonder  | B6--- F#6--- D6--- | F#6--- C#7--- A6--- | D6--- A6--- F#6--- | E6--- B6--- G#6--- |
wonder  | B6--- F#6--- D6--- | F#6--- C#7--- A6--- | G6--- D7--- B6--- | C#7--- G#6--- E#6--- |
timpani | B1!------- F#1--- | F#1!------- C#2--- | D2!------- A1--- | E2!------- B1--- |
timpani | B1!------- F#1--- | F#1!------- C#2--- | G1!------- D2--- | C#2- C#2- C#2- C#2- C#2!- C#2!- |
