tri     | x.......o... | % | % | % |
tri     | % | % | % | x...x...x... |
kick    | X.......x... | % | % | % |
kick    | % | % | % | X...X...X.X. |
snare   | ....x...o... | % | % | % |
snare   | % | % | % | ....x.x.xxxx |
crash   | X........... | ............ | % | % |
crash   | x........... | ............ | % | % |
choir   | [Bm]----------- | [F#m]----------- | [D]----------- | [E]----------- |
choir   | [Bm]----------- | [F#m]----------- | [G]----------- | [C#]----------- |
bell    | B3----------- | F#4----------- | D4----------- | E4----------- |
bell    | B3----------- | F#4----------- | G3----------- | C#4----------- |

loop A B
